$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Halcyon II" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for the final time. Since this is the final conquest only two small pulse turrets will protect each teams flag. You must work hard at both offense and defense if you plan on being the victor. You must capture the other teams flag 30 times, the winner becomes the new Tribe lords!" @
	 "\n<f1>Map Compiled by: <f0> LL Kunochi - Optimizer" @
	 "\n<f1>Special Thanks: <f0> To Watchman over at www.tribe-one.org for all his help and dedication to others!";
